# PROJECT: MICROREACH AI
## Build a premium, full-length SaaS marketing website inspired by the visual quality and page structure of SARAL

You are a senior SaaS product designer, UI/UX architect, and expert React frontend engineer.

Your task is to design and implement a complete, responsive, production-quality public homepage for **MicroReach AI**, an AI-powered micro-influencer discovery, qualification, profile enrichment, and outreach platform.

This is the public marketing website visitors see before signing in. It is NOT the internal application dashboard.

The homepage must communicate the product's value, explain its capabilities, demonstrate the workflow, build trust through transparent product information, and encourage visitors to get started.

